n class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span></span> 为绳与水平夹角）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光滑球在斜面上靠竖直挡板</td>\n<td>同上直角三力模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物体在斜面上匀速下滑</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu=\\tan\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>（&quot;物体恰好滑动&quot;条件）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>邪修提示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>选填三力平衡：<strong>先画闭合三角形再标角</strong>——直角三力用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tan\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span></span>，一般三力用拉密定理；</li>\n<li>&quot;恰好/刚好&quot; + 光滑 ⇒ 先写 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tan\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span></span> 关系再比大小；</li>\n<li>风险：拉密定理的角是&quot;另两个力之间的夹角&quot;，对应关系别弄反；多种力时优先正交分解，别硬套。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["共点力平衡","正交分解","三力平衡","拉密定理","相似三角形"],"summary":"共点力平衡 平衡条件 Σ F = 0 \\Sigma F=0 Σ F = 0 二力平衡 ：等大、反向、共线、同体； 三力平衡 ：任意两个力的合力与第三个力 等大反向 （合成法）；三个力首尾相接构成 闭合三角形 （图解法）； 多力平衡 ：正交分","fit":[],"updated":"Fri Feb 14 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"mechanics","title":"力学"},{"slug":"forces","title":"受力与平衡"},{"slug":"equilibrium","title":"共点力平衡"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"clothesline","title":"晾衣架模型（绳越平拉力越大）","type":"example"},{"slug":"dynamic-balance","title":"动态平衡","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"force-analysis","title":"受力分析","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"right-triangle-balance","title":"直角三力平衡（tanθ 心算）","type":"example"},{"slug":"whole-isolate","title":"整体法求静摩擦力（秒杀）","type":"example"}]}